{"unit_id":"xingyingyuzhui__dsh-liquid-glass#card-zh","repo":"xingyingyuzhui/dsh-liquid-glass","commit":"573a81d66ddff86216a61ebee4c755ed49ae31de","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-liquid-glass 是一款面向 DSH Web 的界面主题插件，在官方浅色、深色与系统主题上叠加壁纸和可选液态玻璃效果。它通过主题与界面插槽注入设置面板，并由宿主提供冰原、深水壁纸。用户可导入图片、调整壁纸透明度和玻璃模糊，也能单独关闭玻璃材质。适合希望自定义 DSH Web 外观的人；无需 API 密钥，设置保存在浏览器本地。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/apply.js:2-43","src/client/settings-view.js:1-120","src/client/controller.js:1-120"]}
{"unit_id":"xingyingyuzhui__dsh-liquid-glass#card-en","repo":"xingyingyuzhui/dsh-liquid-glass","commit":"573a81d66ddff86216a61ebee4c755ed49ae31de","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-liquid-glass adds wallpapers and optional Liquid Glass styling to DSH Web. Its settings panel offers Ice and Deepwater presets, image import, wallpaper opacity and glass blur controls, plus an independent glass toggle. It requires no API key; preferences stay in browser localStorage.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/apply.js:2-43","src/client/settings-view.js:1-120","src/client/controller.js:1-120"]}
